# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# AW-075/IV-058: the Info window's icon is a real drop target that answers
# a hovering drag in its selected coat, and a drag source carrying the item
# itself.
wait 12
press-row 0 3
wait 2
release-row 0 3
wait 3
menu-pick Get info
wait 6
note before the drag, the icon wears its plain coat
expect-pixel 158 120 000000
press 85 138
wait 2
move 300 450
wait 2
move 141 119
wait 3
note hovered by a drag it can take, the icon answers in its selected coat
expect-pixel 158 120 112335
release 141 119
wait 8
note the drop landed: a.txt now lives in sub
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/sub/a.txt
wait 30
note and the icon is a drag SOURCE too: carrying sub out to the desktop
press 156 134
wait 2
move 400 250
wait 2
move 600 300
wait 2
release 600 300
wait 10
expect-file /tmp/trk_home/Desktop/sub/a.txt
quit
